{"version":1,"key":"card:198","content":{"id":198,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c3cd72e5-4fa7-4e0e-89a9-32f1c71575fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"DOM 定义了一个 Node 类型的接口，DOM 树上的节点都实现了该类型，因此所有的节点都有着 Node 接口中规定的属性和方法。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"63b2e2f2-2cc0-4ba6-8ded-91a709239836","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"虽然 HTML 元素以及文本内容都会被转化为节点，但是明显 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"document"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 节点，HTML 元素节点，以及文本节点等等它们之间的地位是不一样的，这意味着虽然大家都是 Node 类型的对象，但是却有着不同，每个节点都有着自己的类型，而 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nodeType"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性正是用来表明节点类型的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a66184fa-2702-4fce-bd97-aaebe41bec3b","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nodeType"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值为数字类型，根据 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nodeType"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值不同，节点类型分为 12 种，如下"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"6477f5a4-a732-441f-a46b-8e075504f1ff","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a0170c4d-851a-484e-8c80-9e748bf21327","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0f8c8146-d32d-4b29-b8f9-c0a1fec7921d","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Node.ELEMENT_NODE(1)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3b0ef57a-5845-4a23-b860-a308dc28db30","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collab